  "body": "Red on ubuntu and macOS CI at 75e78a5a0, b5a78fd8b and 1b039a3c7 (run 40166079788):\n\n```\nproc_test.go:39: internal/tui/keep.go:102 runs a command with os/exec; use proc.Command: cmd := exec.Command(exe, \"serve\")\n```\n\n75e78a5a0 (tui: quitting hands the gateway to magpie's service on Linux) added it. Fix: proc.Command in keep.go.",
