   "updated_at": "2026-10-25T06:49:50Z",
   "body": "Delivered on `fix/tui-keep-proc-command` ([64bd29fa](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/commit/64bd29fa), skygunner's fork, on upstream/main 1b039a3c) — the fix the issue names: `serveInBackground`'s `exec.Command(exe, \"serve\")` is `proc.Command` now, and `os/exec` left the file with its one use gone.\n\nRed reproduced on a clean 1b039a3c checkout before the change (`-count=2`, both red, same guard line); after, `go test ./internal/proc ./internal/tui -count=1` green. `batch`/`hide` are no-ops off Windows and the background path is Linux-only at runtime, so nothing else moves.\n\nRun: gofmt, go vet, windows/amd64 and darwin/arm64 builds.",
   "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
