   "body": "Fixed in cec54c1d0 with your change (credited as co-author): serveInBackground starts serve through proc.Command. The same commit fixes main's other red, TestTreeRSS on ubuntu. It read sleep's RSS before its loader ran (16 KiB) and now waits for it. In golang:1.26 docker the old test was red 13 of 50 and the new one passed 50 of 50. Thanks!",
